Package: gtk4-brotway
Version: ${DEB_VERSION}
Architecture: ${ARCH}
Maintainer: Lev Gorodetskii <github@drsr.io>
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/droserasprout/gtk-brotway
Depends: ${RUNTIME_PKGS}
Description: GTK ${GTK_VERSION} Broadway backend (brotway fork)
 Patched broadway-only libgtk-4 plus the gtk4-broadwayd daemon, filling in
 the Broadway backend's missing pieces (clipboard, touch, zoom, cursors,
 HiDPI, reconnect, rendering fixes). Installed under a private prefix
 (/usr/lib/gtk4-brotway), so it never replaces the system GTK and won't
 break other GTK4 apps. Opt in per launch via gtk4-brotway-run.
